  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Brandon Lobaugh is an American food-industry entrepreneur who founded iQ Foods in Fayetteville, Arkansas. A Texas A&M graduate, he previously worked in technical services and product development at IBP and Tyson Foods. He developed the Suspended Fresh storage programme and continues to lead iQ Foods as part of the Quirch Foods group.",
    "html": "<p>Brandon Lobaugh is an American food-industry entrepreneur who founded iQ Foods in Fayetteville, Arkansas. A Texas A&amp;M graduate, he previously worked in technical services and product development at IBP and Tyson Foods. He developed the Suspended Fresh storage programme and continues to lead iQ Foods as part of the Quirch Foods group.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 53,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 90,
